  "method": "Retrospective evaluation of production Season-view simulations (10,000 deterministic draws per game). Each replay uses pre-tipoff team histories; targets/future scores do not enter their predictions. Outcomes are assumed known five hours after tipoff, not recovered publication timestamps. Calibration trains strictly before 2025-01-01 UTC and evaluates later games. Probabilities are normalized conditional on a non-tied simulated outcome, not an overtime forecast. Fixed ridge logistic recalibration; no test-set tuning. Brier/log-loss lower is better. Log-loss/logit clip probabilities at 1e-6. Reliability intervals are descriptive Wilson intervals; paired Brier differences use 2,000 date-block bootstrap samples. The NBA archive has been inspected in previous research, so this is NOT an untouched final holdout. CBB is ten selected teams, not a league sample. No historical odds, injuries, profits or live-provider acceptance. No calibration or model weights deployed.",
